  "description": "KODIAK, Alaska - A Coast Guard Air Station Kodiak MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew hoists four men 80 miles southwest of Kodiak July 11, 2010, after they abandoned their 52-foot fishing vessel Nakat because it caught on fire.  The fishing vessel's emergency position-indicating radio beacon alerted the Coast Guard at about 8:30 a.m. and the men were taken to Coast Guard base Kodiak in good condition.  U.S. Coast Guard video by Air Station Kodiak.",
